vhdx-mount (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * One-click VHDX mounting with GUI integration
  * Automatic partition detection
  * NTFS filesystem support
  * Desktop notifications
  * File manager integration (Nautilus, Dolphin, Thunar)
  * Optional passwordless mounting
  * Standalone Python GUI application

